 최근 대화/실제 게시 질문 + 원문. 사용 가능한 제한 읽기 도구 계약" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="333" y="751" width="733.04" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e57" value="모델 주도 해석 제어기: 읽기/질문/완성 의미 추론 요청" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="521" y="810" width="524.8" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e59" value="cloud semantic 추론. 음성 입력을 막는 전체 호출 mutex 없음" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="709" y="869" width="622.84" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e61" value="3  다음 행동 제안: 당시 표와 관련 업무 조회" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="709" y="928" width="441.58" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e63" value="모델 결과 반환; 출력은 VIA 코드가 형식·범위 검사" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="521" y="987" width="491.36" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e65" value="읽기 도구 실행기가 모델이 선택한 조회의 범위/예산 검사" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgr